# Round 11, G on the four diagonals: (0,5,10,15), (1,6,11,12), (2,7,8,13), (3,4,9,14).
def diagonal11(v: T.State, x0: T.Lane, x1: T.Lane, x2: T.Lane, x3: T.Lane, x4: T.Lane, x5: T.Lane, x6: T.Lane, x7: T.Lane) -> T.State:
